<title>UK: KFW unit sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KFW</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    07.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NY	  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
